# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Blessed Arm (322), The Black Shield (1319, 1320), Highperch Venom (1135), Hardened Shells (1105),
# Load Lightening (1176), Fiora Longears (1132).
# Level tidy (0.4.0): A Bump in the Road (1175) is left out: its Saltstone Gazers are 34-35, two and three levels over
# players at the Raceway (about 32-33), and the route's next Raceway visit is at 45 (40-50/04-tanaris).
# Fizzle offers Martek the Exiled (1106) once Salt Flat Venom and Hardened Shells are both handed in: taken here, for the
# Badlands at the end of 30-40 (Indurium, 1108), and News for Fizzle (1137) back at the Raceway in 40-50/04.
# Since 2026-11-07 the Mirage Raceway and Dustwallow Marsh's Shady Rest quests are done here, on one crossing to
# Theramore (the Raceway was a crossing of its own at 30 in 07-thousand-needles). The Missing Diplomat's Dustwallow
# part (36-38) and Swamplight Manor stay in 40-50/01.
# Since 0.4.1 the guide ends at Ratchet's dock (#2419), not on the boat to Menethil Harbor: from Theramore the road
# leads to Ratchet (its flight point on the way) and the boat to Booty Bay, where 30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale starts.
# Since the 2026-11-20 fix round the stops this guide already makes take what stands on them: The Missing Diplomat's
# Sentry Point errand (1265, Commander Samaul to Archmage Tervosh at the tower beside the road west), Lieutenant Paval
# Reethe's badge at the Shady Rest Inn and its errands in Foothold Citadel (1252, 1259, 1285), Lonebrow's Journal by
# the foot of the Great Lift (1100, for Falfindel Waywarder north of Highperch), Kravel's Wharfmaster Dizzywig (1111)
# and Pozzik's Goblin Sponsorship (1178, then 1180 for Booty Bay), both handed in at Ratchet beside the boat: about
# 5,100 XP here at 32-33 with only Falfindel's walk added. A Host of Evil (6626) is a group choice: the quilboar
# outside Razorfen Downs are elites of 33-34. Tervosh's next errand to Private Hendel (1266) is taken from him at Sentry
# Point right after the hand-in (he shows there only to players on the chain) and carried to 40-50/01, whose route goes
# to North Point Tower. Left for 40-50/01: The Deserters (1286), whose
# Hendel and Balos Jacken stand off this guide's path; Soothing Spices and The Orc Report (1218, 1219) at Swamplight
# Manor, about 1,300 yards north of the road. Left out: Parts for Kravel (1112, back to the Raceway, which the route
# next visits at 45) and The Crone of the Kraul (1101, inside Razorfen Kraul).
# The Caravan Road (2026-11-20 round): Velinde's The Barrens Port (1039) goes to Ratchet's harbor on the last stop,
# which gives Passage to Booty Bay (1040) for the next guide.

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Red Jack Flint
  zone Wetlands
  tip Red Jack Flint stands by Menethil Keep's door, just north of the flight master.
  accept 1132                         -- For Fiora Longears in Theramore's inn, where this guide's boat goes

step Glorin Steelbrow
  zone Wetlands
  tip Glorin stands in the Deepwater Tavern, south of the keep, where Mikhail and Vincent Hyal wait too.
  turnin 270                          -- Inside
  accept 321

step Deepwater Tavern
  tip Tapoke Jahn (34) slips out of the tavern once you take The Missing Diplomat: stay close behind him. He turns on you outside, a friend joins him, and he gives up once badly hurt. If you lose him the quest fails: abandon it and take it again from Mikhail.
  turnin 1248                         -- Mikhail
  accept 1249
  kill 4962 quest 1249 @10.5,60.3 map 1437 -- Tapoke "Slim" Jahn
  turnin 1249
  accept 1250                         -- Tapoke "Slim" Jahn
  turnin 1301                         -- Vincent Hyal
  accept 1302
  turnin 1250                         -- Mikhail
  accept 1264

step Waterlogged Chest
  tip The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep.
  turnin 321
  accept 324

step Lightforge Ingots
  tip The Bluegill murlocs on the beach south-west of Menethil carry the ingots.
  collect 2702 quest 324              -- Lightforge Ingot; underwater

step Glorin Steelbrow
  turnin 324                          -- Inside
  accept 322                          -- For Grimand Elmore in Stormwind, after Stranglethorn

