  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Theramore

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The flight master stands by the gate of Foothold Citadel; Clerk Lendry and Commander Samaul are inside the citadel.
  getfp "Theramore"
  turnin 1302                         -- Clerk Lendry, on the top floor
  turnin 1264                         -- Commander Samaul, on the top floor
  accept 1265                         -- Commander Samaul: Sentry Point is the watchtower on the road west, next
  turnin 1132                         -- Fiora Longears, inside the inn in the north of town
  note Fiora's next errand goes to Astranaar, off this route: leave it.
  accept 1135                         -- Fiora Longears: the wyverns are in Thousand Needles, later in this guide

step Sentry Point
  tip Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at Sentry Point, where the road to the Shady Rest Inn turns west. Look around the tower: Archmage Tervosh appears at its foot, and you hand the quest in to him there.
  complete 1265 @59.9,40.9
  turnin 1265 @59.7,41.2              -- Archmage Tervosh, at the foot of the tower
  accept 1266 @59.7,41.2              -- Archmage Tervosh: Private Hendel holds North Point Tower, for the Dustwallow Marsh visit at 39
  note Take Tervosh's next errand now: he stands here only right after the hand-in. Private Hendel waits for the next Dustwallow Marsh visit, at about 39.

step The Shady Rest Inn
  tip Follow the road west to the burned inn on the road toward the Barrens: the black shield and Reethe's guard badge lie in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn.
  accept 1284 @29.7,47.6              -- Hoofprints
  accept 1253                         -- Black Shield
  accept 1252 @29.8,48.2              -- Theramore Guard Badge: for Captain Vimes, on the way back through Theramore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thousand Needles

step Into The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  goto 49.5,78.4 "Into The Barrens"

step Takar the Seer
  only Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards.
  turnin 1716                             -- Takar the Seer
  accept 1738                             -- Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace
  accept 65602 optional                   -- What Is Love?: the incubus, beside the succubus; the Wooden Figurine is near the Heartswood

step Myriam Moonsinger
  when group 6626
  zone The Barrens
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Myriam Moonsinger stands by the entrance of Razorfen Downs, a few hundred yards north-east of the top of the Great Lift; the Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (33-34, elite) hold the thorny slopes around her. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 6626                             -- Myriam Moonsinger
  kill 7873 quest 6626.1                  -- Razorfen Battleguard
  kill 7874 quest 6626.2                  -- Razorfen Thornweaver
  kill 7872 quest 6626.3                  -- Death's Head Cultist
  turnin 6626

step Henrig Lonebrow's Journal
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Down the Great Lift into Thousand Needles. Careful: wait on the platform until the lift is level with it before you step on, and stay on it until it stops; the drop beside it kills. Henrig Lonebrow's Journal lies a couple of hundred yards north-east of the lift's foot, in Darkcloud Pinnacle, where the Grimtotems (25-27) camp.
  accept 1100 @31.3,28.1                  -- Henrig Lonebrow's Journal: for Falfindel Waywarder, just past Highperch

step Highperch
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip West to the wyverns' cliffs at Highperch. Every wyvern there can drop a venom sac.
  collect 5809 quest 1135             -- Highperch Venom Sac

step Falfindel Waywarder
  zone Feralas
  tip Falfindel camps north of Highperch, just over the border into Feralas on the path up to Thalanaar: hand him the journal. His next quest is inside Razorfen Kraul: leave it.
  turnin 1100                         -- Falfindel Waywarder

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 46.3,40.9 "The canyons east of Highperch"

