step Mirage Raceway
  tip Follow the canyons east to the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions.
  accept 5762                             -- For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later
  accept 1110                             -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 1104                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1179                             -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1105                             -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1176                             -- Pozzik

step Mirage Raceway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers and Salt Flats Scavengers roam the north half, Sparkleshell Tortoises (30-31) the middle of the flats: hunt them for the shells. Careful: Sparkleshell Snappers (34-35) wander the whole flats, and the Saltstone Gazers (34-35) and Scorpid Terrors (33-34) hold the far south: leave them and keep to the north half.
  tip Careful: Ironeye the Invincible (37, rare) roams the south-east of the flats, around 83-88,71-84: leave it be.
  collect 5794 quest 1104                 -- Salty Scorpid Venom
  collect 5798 quest 1110                 -- Rocket Car Parts
  collect 5848 quest 1176                 -- Hollow Vulture Bone
  collect 5795 quest 1105 @76.4,58.2 map 1441 -- Hardened Tortoise Shell, from the Sparkleshell Tortoises
  collect 5675 quest 1078.1 optional      -- Crystalized Scale, from the Saltstone Basilisks: eight for Collin Mauren in Stormwind

