step Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip From Theramore follow the road north-west through the marsh into the Barrens and up the coast to Ratchet: Stranglethorn starts at Booty Bay, across the sea. Ratchet's gryphon master stands above the dock; Gazlowe is upstairs in the house above it; Wharfmaster Dizzywig waits on the dock by the boat.
  getfp "Ratchet"
  turnin 1178                         -- Gazlowe
  accept 1180                         -- Gazlowe: for Wharfmaster Lozgil, on Booty Bay's dock where the boat lands
  turnin 1111                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig
  turnin 1039                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig: The Barrens Port, from Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus
  accept 1040                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig: for Caravaneer Ruzzgot in Booty Bay, where the boat lands
  note Dizzywig's next errand goes back to the Mirage Raceway, which the route next visits at 45: leave it.

